What Exists Today:
Solar Impulse 2: Can fly forever BUT very slow (100 km/h)
Normal planes: Fast (900 km/h) BUT need fuel (limited time)
YOUR DIVERGENTE:
Fast (648 km/h) AND infinite endurance
Can fly for DAYS without stopping
NOBODY has achieved both before! ✅
